  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1402.39 Original loan agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1402.39 “Original loan agreement” means the initial financial assistance agreement between the state and a governmental recipient through which the state agrees to provide funds from the PFAS RLF to the recipient and the recipient promises to repay the funds to the PFAS RLF.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21; renumbered by #13289 (formerly Env-Dw 1402.37); ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
